# Production build settings.
#
# Both of these are designed to ship in the browser: the publishable key grants
# nothing on its own, and row-level security is what actually protects the data.
# They live here so a deploy needs no dashboard fiddling to work.
#
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY is deliberately NOT here — it is a real secret. Set it in
# Vercel's project settings if you want the "paste your menu" shortcut. Without
# it that one route returns 503 and the form hides the paste box; everything
# else works.
